in it," but none of tliem attempted to explain the paper.

"If there's no meaning in it/' said the King, "that saves a world of trouble, you know, as we needn't try to find any. And yet I don't know," he went on, spreading out the vei-ses on his knee, and looking at them with one eye ; "I seem to see some meaning in them, after all. ' — said I could not sivim — ' you can't swim, can you 1 " he added, turning to the Knave.

The Knave shook his head sadly. " Do I look like it 1 " he said. (Which he certainly did not, being made entirely of cardboard.)

"All right, so far," said the King, and he went on muttering over the verses to himself: " ' We know it to he true — ' that's the jury, of course — ' / gave her one, they gave hitti two — ' why, that must be what he did with the tarts, you know "

"But it goes on 'they all returned from him to you,'" said Alice.

